{"version":1,"content":"<p>【定心丸 😂】面對 Sony 宣佈將於 2028 年 1 月起全面停產 PlayStation 實體遊戲光碟所引發的業界爭議，任天堂（Nintendo）高層日前首度正面回應，明確表示旗下次世代主機 Nintendo Switch 2 目前絕無放棄實體遊戲媒介的規劃，承諾將繼續尊重並滿足廣大玩家對實體收藏與二手交易的需求。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T11:19:07.855860+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":161,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T11:00:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T21:37:41.221144+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T11:17:37.008798+00:00","content_hash":"b6060b3541f62bd54731f280559c83fd03eb0ec82280864e3277a2d1d06b0818","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}